# Cloudflare Pages redirects. FIRST MATCH WINS, so every specific rule must sit
# above the SPA catch-all on the last line.
#
# The bulk of this file exists to carry the OLD WIX SITE'S SEARCH RANKINGS across
# the cutover. The Wix sitemap listed 54 indexed URLs on 2026-08-11; only 17 of
# them exist unchanged on the new site, because the new shop publishes one page
# per VARIANT where Wix published one page per PRODUCT. Without the rules below,
# 37 indexed URLs — including every salt lamp and every salt lick — would return
# a 404 the moment DNS moves, and the domain's accumulated authority with them.
#
# A dead URL must always land on the most specific real page available. Sending
# it to the homepage instead is read by search engines as a soft 404 and earns
# nothing. Where Wix had one page and the new site has several variants, the
# redirect points at the entry-level or representative variant; the customer can
# reach the others from there.
#
# To regenerate the inventory this was built from:
#   curl -s https://www.saltylamps.co.uk/sitemap.xml   # (while Wix is still live)
# and diff its <loc> values against dist/*sitemap*.xml after `npm run build`.

# --- Canonical host: apex and bare http to https://www --------------------------
http://saltylamps.co.uk/* https://www.saltylamps.co.uk/:splat 301
https://saltylamps.co.uk/* https://www.saltylamps.co.uk/:splat 301
http://www.saltylamps.co.uk/* https://www.saltylamps.co.uk/:splat 301

